Subject: [PATCH] 3c checker (terminal lens): failing tests of four verified
 findings on dec1cfef

- edge-bff tests/test_c3c_terminal_checker.py: terminal-api's refusals made before it
  identifies the caller carry no x-terminal-capabilities-applied, and relayed logs them for
  every capped principal as "terminal-api is older than Phase 3c" without the upstream code;
  the live site sends user #1 as admin false with no quota (terminal-api's defaults).
- Terminal vitest tests/data/c3c_cut_refusal_words.test.ts: a refused cut download
  (429 LIMIT_REACHED, 403 CAPABILITY_REQUIRED) reaches the person as "A data file could not
  be downloaded (429)."
- terminal-api tests/test_c3c_terminal_checker.py: a capped plan gets a history lock, not
  "no files", for a dataset the ticker does not have.

